          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "Layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cp\u003ENavigational links is a TPR component that allows you to create a list of navigational links with the option of additional styling such as:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003EBullet points;\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003ENumbered lists;\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003EFont customisation (Headings, bold text, italics, etc.).\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe most common use case of this component is for lists of anchor links that are usually placed near the beginning of a page that allow the user to immediately navigate to a specific point within that same page.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFor example:\u003C/p\u003E"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "ed7a51d3-39d6-4865-a922-13d3835bc9aa",
      "key": "0ddbdd66-3350-4715-b63e-c24c2c16146f",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "label",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": ""
        },
        {
          "alias": "text",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "Layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Ch2 class=\u0022govuk-heading-m\u0022\u003EIn Page Anchors\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022#section1\u0022 data-anchor=\u0022#section1\u0022\u003ESection 1\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022#section2\u0022 data-anchor=\u0022#section2\u0022\u003ESection 2\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022#section3\u0022 data-anchor=\u0022#section3\u0022\u003ESection 3\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003C/ul\u003E"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "e0876897-88f4-4dcf-ae0a-ec5a37e3a185",
      "key": "4884a5dc-3bbf-43a4-a7ed-45ad9c28287d",
